# Third-party wrappers that MultiGCN does NOT own.
#
# Only TIGRESS, MEOMI, INFERELATOR and NONLINEARODES still come from GENECI via
# `python -m multigcn.inference.vendor`. Everything else in scripts/ is
# MultiGCN's own code and MUST be committed.
#
# Listed by exact filename on purpose: a blanket `scripts/r/*.R` also swallows
# our own wrappers, which then vanish on a fresh clone and get silently
# replaced by GENECI's incompatible versions during vendoring.
multigcn/inference/scripts/r/TIGRESS.R
multigcn/inference/scripts/r/MEOMI.R
multigcn/inference/scripts/r/MEOMI_src/
multigcn/inference/scripts/r/functions.R
multigcn/inference/scripts/python/INFERELATOR.py
multigcn/inference/scripts/python/NONLINEARODES.py
